    {
      "source": "Couchbase-backed Cache Methods that take a Class return non-wrapped objects - cache-miss cannot be distinguished from\ncached null - this is what AbstractValueAdaptingCache does Methods that do not take a Class return wrapped objects -\nthe wrapper is null for cache-miss - the exception is T get(final Object key, final Callable&lt;T&gt; valueLoader), which\ndoes not return a wrapper because if there is a cache-miss, it gets the value from valueLoader (and caches it). There\nare anomalies with get(key, ValueLoader) - which returns non-wrapped object.",
      "translation": "由 Couchbase 支持的缓存方法若接受 Class 参数，则返回非包装对象——无法区分缓存未命中与缓存的 null 值，这正是 AbstractValueAdaptingCache 所采用的策略；而若不接收 Class 参数的方法则返回包装对象——缓存未命中时包装器为 null。唯一的例外是 `T get(final Object key, final Callable<T> valueLoader)` 方法，它不返回包装对象，因为若发生缓存未命中，它会从 valueLoader 获取值（并将其缓存）。然而，`get(key, ValueLoader)` 方法存在异常行为——它返回的是非包装对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if <code>key</code> cannot be converted to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果无法将 <code>key</code> 转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
